OL,3,ANorwegians lay flowers at palace as
OL,4,AKing Harald's condition worsens
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorwegians have laid flowers in front
OL,7,Fof the palace in Oslo after the royal
OL,8,Fhousehold said King Harald V's
OL,9,Fcondition in hospital had become
OL,10,F"extremely serious".
OL,12,FHis wife, Queen Sonja, and his son,
OL,13,FCrown Prince Haakon, cancelled royal
OL,14,Fengagements to be at his bedside at
OL,15,FOslo University Hospital with other
OL,16,Fmembers of the family. They left later
OL,17,Fin the day.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
