OL,3,ANorwegians lay flowers at palace as
OL,4,AKing Harald's condition worsens
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 89-year-old has been in hospital
OL,7,Ffor 10 days receiving treatment for a
OL,8,Frare blood condition, haemolytic
OL,9,Fanaemia. Late on Thursday afternoon the
OL,10,Fpalace issued an update to say his
OL,11,Fcondition was unchanged.
OL,13,FHaving been on the throne since 1991,
OL,14,FKing Harald is Europe's oldest head of
OL,15,Fstate.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
